  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Mia and Mom are at the beach. Pat is here too. He is a boy. A baby is with him. \"Hello, Pat!\" says Mia. \"Hello, Mia!\" says Pat.",
      "It is dinner. Mom has a coconut. \"Coconut, please,\" says Pat. \"Here you are,\" says Mom. \"Thank you!\" says Pat. Oh no! Mia hits the coconut. It is in the sand. \"Sorry, Pat!\" says Mia. \"Don't worry,\" says Pat.",
      "Mom has a new one. Mia has a chocolate. The baby wants it. Mia gives it. The baby claps. Is it a good dinner? Yes, it is! \"Goodbye, Pat!\" says Mia."
    ],
